{\b\fs22 StarDad Companion: terms of use and licence}\par
Please read these terms. By installing StarDad Companion you agree to them. If you don't agree, choose Cancel.\par
{\b 1. Unofficial fan project.} StarDad is run by AJ Solutions, LLC. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Cloud Imperium Games or Roberts Space Industries. Star Citizen and related marks are theirs.\par
{\b 2. What the app does.} Newly linked PCs sync every 3 hours by default and start the app with Windows while automatic syncing is on. Change or turn off the schedule in your account. Existing saved schedules are kept. When a scheduled sync runs, or you press Send to my PC on stardad.space or Sync in the app, it reads your game logs on this PC and installs your StarDad file into your game folder. It changes only data\\Localization\\english\\global.ini and the two language lines in user.cfg, and only after you allow it. It waits while the game is running. It never reads or changes Data.p4k, never touches the running game, and never runs anything it downloads except a StarDad update you choose to install, which must be signed with StarDad's release key.\par
{\b 3. What it sends to stardad.space}, and only when you sync: blueprint names with their dates and finished contract titles from your logs, this PC's name (when you link it), the stage of each sync, and the fingerprint of the file it installed. It sends nothing else about you, your PC or your game. See stardad.space/privacy.\par
{\b 4. Restart the game.} The game reads the file when it starts. After a sync, restart the game to see the changes.\par
{\b 5. No warranty.} The app and its data come from the game files and community sources (such as UEX prices) and may be wrong or out of date, especially right after a patch. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR ITS USE. You use it at your own risk. You can remove its file from the game at any time from the app's menu, and uninstall the app from Windows Settings.\par
{\b 6. Licence.} Copyright (c) 2026 AJ Solutions, LLC. All rights reserved. The source code is published at github.com/aj3/stardad-companion so anyone can check what it does. You may read and review it, build it on your own computer only to check it matches a release, and publish the results of a security review. You may not copy, modify or distribute it or any build of it, publish a program based on it or presenting itself as StarDad Companion, or use the StarDad name or logo, without written permission. Official builds come only from stardad.space.\par
